N/A ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])}}'''Bronze Snow Dagger''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife obtained by finishing third on the gifting leaderboard {{Currency|Gift}} during the [[Christmas Event 2025]].

== Appearance ==
It has the same mesh as the godly variant of [[Snow Dagger]], but it's color scheme has been altered to bronze colors.

== Trivia ==

* It has [[Gold Snow Dagger|gold]], [[Silver Snow Dagger|silver]] and [[Red Snow Dagger|red]] variants.
* Like all the other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (Except [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].

* The sole owner of this item is [https://www.roblox.com/users/120556754/profile n9ughty].

